# Never commit real email. A real message carries personal data (yours and other
# people's) and, if it is phishing, live malicious links and attachments.
# The only .eml files in this repository are the made-up ones under tests/fixtures/.
*.eml
*.msg
*.mbox
*.pst
samples/
phishing-samples/
!tests/fixtures/*.eml

